[ar:Glass Orchard]
[al:After the Rain]
[ti:Silver Line]
[00:01.25]Rain leaves a silver line behind.
[00:05.75]The glass remembers every light.
[00:10.25]Green opens slowly in the morning.
[00:14.75]And violet gathers up the night.
[00:19.25]We take the long way through the garden.
[00:23.75]We let the heavy weather go.
[00:28.25]A softer world beneath the surface.
[00:32.75]A little room for things to grow.
